<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anadigics added to list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anadigics added to list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said on Tuesday it had added Anadigics Inc to its U.S. recommended list.</p>
<p>-- The stock had been rated market outperform</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were up 1/2 at 24.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
